      {
        "description": "FullCompensation involves, secondly, individual interviews with adjudicators from selected national jurisdictions in the EU. While the case-law represents a critical source of evidence on the full compensation of non-pecuniary damages, some factors and mechanisms may not emerge from a case-law review. An alternative source of valuable information is provided by individually interviewing the adjudicators themselves, asking them about their views and experiences related to the use of guidelines for quantifying non-pecuniary damages in personal injury cases.",
